      "title": "Clarifying Treaty-Making Under Syria's Constitutional Declaration: Legal Gaps and Legislative Options",
      "description": "This paper examines the legal and institutional questions that arise when Syria seeks to join new international conventions, and proposes legislative options to ensure parliamentary oversight and legal certainty.",
      "author": "Haddon Barth",
